ss></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NOGUCHI, FUJIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SHIOMI, TAKAYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A remote controller and an image display device are applicable to a television receiver and a remote commander for controlling the television receiver, for instance, to facilitate a control program upgrade. A remote controller (2) is composed so as to receive an IC card (3). The data recorded on the IC card (3) are transmitted to devices to be controlled so that control programs and menu screens can be updated. Video data and audio data are also transmitted.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Dispositif de commande à distance et dispositif d'affichage vidéo conçus pour un récepteur de télévision afin de faciliter, par exemple, la valorisation du programme de commande. Ce dispositif de commande à distance (2) est adapté de manière à recevoir une carte de circuits intégrés (3). Les données enregistrées sur cette carte (3) sont transmises aux dispositifs à commander afin de mettre à jour les programmes de commande et les écrans de menu. Des données vidéo et audio sont également transmises.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>